TVLWeightedContainers::addContainer()
├── given invalid container parameters
│   └── it should inherit all validation tests from TVLWeightedContainersValidation
└── given valid container parameters
    ├── it should increment totalContainerCount
    ├── it should assign correct container ID starting from 1
    ├── it should set currentDurationEpochs to duration min
    ├── it should set isActive to false
    ├── it should store container with provided parameters
    ├── it should emit ContainerAdded event
    ├── it should return the container ID
    └── when adding multiple containers
        ├── it should assign sequential container IDs
        ├── it should increment totalContainerCount for each
        └── it should store all containers correctly 